        <detaileddescription>
<para>Deallocate memory.</para><para>Deallocates a block of memory that was allocated by the <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1DefaultAllocator_1a8cb71da8e6fefb1d32e303a3dc48469e" kindref="member">allocate</ref> method and which has not been deallocated in the mean time. The <computeroutput>addr</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>size</computeroutput> must be the address returned by <ref refid="classSawyer_1_1DefaultAllocator_1a8cb71da8e6fefb1d32e303a3dc48469e" kindref="member">allocate</ref> and the size that was used to request that block. </para>        </detaileddescription>
