    <detaileddescription>
<para>Default allocator.</para><para>This is the default allocator used by all <ref refid="namespaceSawyer" kindref="compound">Sawyer</ref> container classes. It simply delegates to the normal C++ global <computeroutput>new</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>delete</computeroutput> allocator. </para>    </detaileddescription>
